From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:49:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cache parsed query selectors and hint sibling indexes

Scripts repeat a few selectors in loops, and parsing dominated short queries. Sibling steps searched the parent's child list from the start, which made walks over long child lists quadratic. A small thread-local hint per parent slot, always checked against the list, makes in-order steps constant time without growing Node.

Signed-off-by: Bernardo Pereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
